{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\"><transition event=\"go\" target=\"zz‮DER\"/></state>\n  <final id=\"REDzz\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml005-bidi-control-in-target.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":1},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml005-bidi-control-in-target.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":54,"endLine":2,"startColumn":48,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"transition target `zz‮DER` does not exist\n\n**Note:** a transition's `target` must be one or more IDs of states in the same SCXML document; an unresolved target makes the document non-conformant\n\n**Help:** declare the target state or correct the target identifier\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.5 <transition>","text":"transition target `zz‮DER` does not exist"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":129,"start":121},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML005"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml005-bidi-control-in-target.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":3,"byteOffset":123,"endColumn":51,"endLine":2,"startColumn":50,"startLine":2},"insertedContent":{"text":"&#x202E;"}}]}],"description":{"text":"write the control character as a character reference"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml005-bidi-control-in-target.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":51,"endLine":2,"startColumn":50,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"a Unicode bidirectional control character changes how this line is displayed\n\n**Note:** an explicit embedding, override, or isolate reorders how the text around it is displayed, so an editor or review can show a condition, ID, or script differently from what the machine executes (Trojan Source, CVE-2021-42574)\n\n**Help:** if the character is intended, write it as a character reference such as `&#x202E;`, which XML decodes to the same character and keeps visible; otherwise remove it\n\n**Spec:** Unicode Standard Annex #9 §2 Directional Formatting Characters","text":"a Unicode bidirectional control character changes how this line is displayed"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":126,"start":123},"category":"lint"},"ruleId":"LINT016"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"an explicit embedding, override, or isolate (U+202A-U+202E, U+2066-U+2069) reorders how the text around it is displayed, so an editor or review can show a condition, ID, or script differently from what the machine executes (Trojan Source, CVE-2021-42574); rustc rejects the same characters in literals"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: write an intended control as a character reference such as `&#x202E;`, which XML decodes to the same character in an attribute value or text and keeps visible (the finding offers this fix), or remove it.\n\nSpecification: Unicode Standard Annex #9 §2 Directional Formatting Characters\n\nRun `scx --explain LINT016` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr9/#Directional_Formatting_Characters","id":"LINT016","name":"LINT016","properties":{"category":"lint"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a Unicode bidirectional control character changes how the source is displayed"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"a transition's `target` must be one or more IDs of states in the same SCXML document; an unresolved target makes the document non-conformant"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: correct the identifier or declare the missing state.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.5 <transition>\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML005` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#transition","id":"SCXML005","name":"SCXML005","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a transition target does not name a state in this document"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}